Mirror of RNA E1': cheap V0 accepts ~all it SOLVES; robustness (median rho | SAT) DROPS as alpha -> threshold. V0-accept<100% at high alpha = cheap-solver reach limit (raise --budget), reported separately so it does not contaminate the fragility signal.
